        "id": 257629,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-04-04T16:36:53.360Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> This sounds cool!</p>\n<p>In case you hadn’t seen them and are interested, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Greater-Than-Games-Spirit-Island/dp/B0CKX8XHPM?th=1\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the second premium token pack</a> includes tokens that are identical to the original defense tokens (image below). <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> But if you want to make your own, I definitely understand. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1/2.png?v=12\" title=\":+1:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:t2:\"></p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I have no idea what wood they’re made of. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> You might be able to email <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a> and see if they can help you?</p>\n<p>I’m honestly not sure if it’ll be discernable once they’re painted, though. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\"> (Not saying that it is or isn’t – I honestly just don’t know. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=12\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\">)</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a_2_690x222.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4rNfzd3GrN5nO7HmOW4Zg8saDQC\" width=\"690\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a_2_690x222.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a_2_1035x333.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a_2_1380x444.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1f2d0479bbda59ca8a314a7bd487152b512a024a_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1500×484 67 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
