        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Welcome! :D This sounds cool! \n\nIn case you hadn't seen them and are interested, [the second premium token pack](https://www.amazon.com/Greater-Than-Games-Spirit-Island/dp/B0CKX8XHPM?th=1) includes tokens that are identical to the original defense tokens (image below). :) But if you want to make your own, I definitely understand. :+1:t2:\n\nUnfortunately, I have no idea what wood they're made of. :confused: You might be able to email contact@greaterthangames.com and see if they can help you? \n\nI'm honestly not sure if it'll be discernable once they're painted, though. :thinking: (Not saying that it is or isn't -- I honestly just don't know. :blush:)  \n\n![image|690x222](upload://4rNfzd3GrN5nO7HmOW4Zg8saDQC.jpeg)",
