        "cooked": "<p>Thanks both!</p>\n<p>Yeah I actually have premium token pack 2, but I’m looking to make ones with numbers printed on them, in that kind of shield shape the digital game uses. Especially for events that add defend to places where Dahan are, and that sort of thing.</p>\n<p>I’m gonna look into maple! As long as it feels about the same weight and hardness after painting, I’ll be happy.</p>",
